{"4173790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Osteomalacia", "steam_appid": 4173790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Osteomalacia is a top-down survival shooter set in a post-apocalyptic city. Your main goal is to find a way out of this nightmare, overrun by mutated people and animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experimental bomb detonated above your city. Instead of burning it down, the explosion shrouded the streets in a thick black fog. You immediately notice the sudden disappearance of the Sun. Stepping outside, you witness every living thing around you mutated and transformed. It didn’t affect you—at least not yet. But soon, surviving will be all that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, your only hope is to escape this land of abominations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[First step]:</strong> Explore randomly generated streets of this city, enter as many buildings as you can, and find whatever left of it previous owners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173790/extras/f6fa5a828febf7c912323a967f8f247f.poster.avif?t=1785624414\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173790/extras/f6fa5a828febf7c912323a967f8f247f.webm?t=1785624414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173790/extras/f6fa5a828febf7c912323a967f8f247f.mp4?t=1785624414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Second step]:</strong> Escape location before the emission or consequences of your noise pollution and return home with all your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173790/extras/2cf4f04fee4440562441305392302a31.poster.avif?t=1785624414\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173790/extras/2cf4f04fee4440562441305392302a31.webm?t=1785624414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173790/extras/2cf4f04fee4440562441305392302a31.mp4?t=1785624414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Third step]:</strong> Upgrade your equipment, salvage junk and Improve your skills from the newly earned experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Fourth step]: </strong>Receive a radio signal? Wait, someone else is alive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Final step]: Escape...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or not...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173790/extras/211beb9262f9253cb1d6de71866c8c97.poster.avif?t=1785624414\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173790/extras/211beb9262f9253cb1d6de71866c8c97.webm?t=1785624414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173790/extras/211beb9262f9253cb1d6de71866c8c97.mp4?t=1785624414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge thanks to Gloronic for cover artwork.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Osteomalacia is a top-down survival shooter set in a post-apocalyptic city. Your main goal is to find a way out of this nightmare, overrun by mutated people and animals.</p><p 